        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.74,
          "end": 25.95,
          "en": "if sending succeeded,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.95,
          "end": 30.49,
          "en": "and I wanna show the error notification if sending failed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.49,
          "end": 32.26,
          "en": "Now, to make all of that happen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.26,
          "end": 35.11,
          "en": "in the NewsletterRegistration component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.11,
          "end": 37.56,
          "en": "we need to connect to context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.56,
          "end": 41.47,
          "en": "And we do that with the useContext hook, as you learned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.47,
          "end": 44.05,
          "en": "So here we then call useContext",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.05,
          "end": 48.54,
          "en": "and we simply import the NotificationContext.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.54,
          "end": 52.51,
          "en": "So again, not the provider, but the context itself",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.51,
          "end": 57.51,
          "en": "from our store and there to notification-context file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.81,
          "end": 60.22,
          "en": "And then we establish this connection",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.22,
          "end": 63.69,
          "en": "as we did it before a couple of minutes ago.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.69,
          "end": 66.84,
          "en": "So here we then have our notificationContext.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.84,
          "end": 69.52,
          "en": "But here I'm not interested in the notification,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.52,
          "end": 71.99,
          "en": "here instead, I wanna call a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.99,
          "end": 74.42,
          "en": "to show the notification.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.42,
          "end": 77.01,
          "en": "For example, here in the registrationHandler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.01,
          "end": 79.46000000000001,
          "en": "when we start sending this request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 79.46000000000001,
          "end": 83.41,
          "en": "Right before we do send it, I want to show a notification",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.41,
          "end": 85.85,
          "en": "that is in the pending status",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.85,
          "end": 89.27,
          "en": "that says something like signing up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.27,
          "end": 92.78999999999999,
          "en": "So for this, we can use the notificationContext object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 92.78999999999999,
          "end": 95.22999999999999,
          "en": "and call showNotification",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 95.22999999999999,
          "end": 98.91,
          "en": "and pass a object with the notification data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.91,
          "end": 102.893,
          "en": "And here all set a title of Signing up,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 103.78,
          "end": 108.78,
          "en": "a message of Registering for newsletter, something like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 112.49000000000001,
          "end": 116.68299999999999,
          "en": "and set the status here to pending, because we are pending.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 118.06,
          "end": 120.17,
          "en": "Now, if we are successful,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 120.17,
          "end": 122.49,
          "en": "so in this last then block here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 122.49,
          "end": 127.47,
          "en": "then I want to set the notification to success.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 127.47,
          "end": 131.54,
          "en": "So in here I'll actually call showNotification again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 131.54,
          "end": 134.21,
          "en": "but then say, \"Success.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 134.21,
          "end": 136.62,
          "en": "As a title and as a text here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 136.62,
          "end": 141.62,
          "en": "we can say, \"Successfully registered for newsletter.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 143.8,
          "end": 145.51,
          "en": "Something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 145.51,
          "end": 148.663,
          "en": "And the status is success instead of pending.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 149.87,
          "end": 151.36,
          "en": "Now, in case of an error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 151.36,
          "end": 154.74,
          "en": "I also wanna show the appropriate notification",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 154.74,
          "end": 157.42000000000002,
          "en": "and that's why I will add a catch method here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 157.42000000000002,
          "end": 159.51,
          "en": "where we get a potential error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 159.51,
          "end": 162.38,
          "en": "and here I also wanna show a notification",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 162.38,
          "end": 167.38,
          "en": "but the status will be error, the title will be Error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 167.45,
          "end": 170.76,
          "en": "and the message could be retrieved from the error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 170.76,
          "end": 173.41,
          "en": "Here we could check if we have a message property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 173.41,
          "end": 174.42000000000002,
          "en": "which we wanna use,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 174.42000000000002,
          "end": 177.74,
          "en": "and alternatively just say, \"Something went wrong.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 177.74,
          "end": 180.29,
          "en": "So we show the error message if we have it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 180.29,
          "end": 181.77,
          "en": "or we showed us fallback",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 181.77,
          "end": 184.593,
          "en": "if there is no message attached to the error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 186.3,
          "end": 188.7,
          "en": "Now, one problem we'll have here is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 188.7,
          "end": 193.7,
          "en": "that the fetch function works such that error HTTP codes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 195.45,
          "end": 198.56,
          "en": "So 400 and 500 status codes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 198.56,
          "end": 202.62,
          "en": "will not cost is promise to fail.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 202.62,
          "end": 205.35,
          "en": "So we will not make it into this catch block",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 205.35,
          "end": 207.76,
          "en": "if we have an error status code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 207.76,
          "end": 209.21,
          "en": "And I would like to make it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 209.21,
          "end": 212.07,
          "en": "into this catch block if that's case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 212.07,
          "end": 215.32999999999998,
          "en": "So to make sure that this is how everything works",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 215.32999999999998,
          "end": 218.91,
          "en": "I will actually dive into this then block",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 218.91,
          "end": 222.92000000000002,
          "en": "and check if response.ok.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 222.92000000000002,
          "end": 227.35,
          "en": "This is the extra field with this response object has.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 227.35,
          "end": 228.48,
          "en": "And if that's the case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 228.48,
          "end": 231.44,
          "en": "I know that we have a success status code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 231.44,
          "end": 234.373,
          "en": "Then I wanna return response.jason.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 235.21,
          "end": 239.09,
          "en": "If that's not okay, though, if we make it past this if check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 239.09,
          "end": 241.19,
          "en": "then I know that we have an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 241.19,
          "end": 245.63,
          "en": "In this case, I also wanna get my response data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 245.63,
          "end": 249.73,
          "en": "but I also want to throw an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 249.73,
          "end": 253.03,
          "en": "I wanna reject that promise by throwing an error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 253.03,
          "end": 255.34,
          "en": "inside of the then block.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 255.34,
          "end": 258.21,
          "en": "And for data here, when using then catch",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 258.21,
          "end": 262.14,
          "en": "instead of async await, we'll need a nest that promise",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 262.14,
          "end": 265.39,
          "en": "because I'll need to get access to the response object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 265.39,
          "end": 266.48,
          "en": "while it's getting access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 266.48,
          "end": 269.58,
          "en": "to the past data at the same time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 269.58,
          "end": 272.61,
          "en": "So here all then called response.jason as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 272.61,
          "end": 273.87,
          "en": "but I'll not return it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 273.87,
          "end": 277.28,
          "en": "But instead here in the then block,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 277.28,
          "end": 279.93,
          "en": "I noted we're already in the error case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 279.93,
          "end": 281.8,
          "en": "because we're past this if check,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 281.8,
          "end": 286.8,
          "en": "here I will then throw a new Error with a message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 287.02,
          "end": 288.67,
          "en": "which I get from my data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 288.67,
          "end": 292.08,
          "en": "Here I'll check if I got a message in my response",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 292.08,
          "end": 294.25,
          "en": "which I got back from the server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 294.25,
          "end": 297.51,
          "en": "and I'll use stat as an error message if I have one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 297.51,
          "end": 300.597,
          "en": "otherwise I'll set up fallback here as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 300.597,
          "end": 302.177,
          "en": "\"Something went wrong.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 303.64,
          "end": 305.93,
          "en": "And now you're all returned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 305.93,
          "end": 309.4,
          "en": "this promise chain, this nest of promise chain",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 309.4,
          "end": 313.17,
          "en": "which will throw an error if things go wrong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 313.17,
          "end": 316.06,
          "en": "And this will then cause the outer promise chain,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 316.06,
          "end": 320.43,
          "en": "the main promise chain started by fetch to reject as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 320.43,
          "end": 323.58,
          "en": "with that error passed along so that'd be make it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 323.58,
          "end": 325.943,
          "en": "into this catch block if we do have an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 327.07,
          "end": 330.97,
          "en": "So with all that implemented, we can try if this works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 330.97,
          "end": 334.4,
          "en": "If we save everything and I reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 334.4,
          "end": 339.4,
          "en": "if I sign up for my newsletter here and I click register",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 339.52,
          "end": 341.74,
          "en": "we see the signing up notification",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
